### Get Operator Call Snapshot
GET {{host}}/api/operator/calls/PJSIP-trunk-0000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Whisper (a blank or >1000-char message is 400 VALIDATION_FAILED)
POST {{host}}/api/operator/calls/PJSIP-trunk-0000001/whisper
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Mijozga 10 foiz chegirma taklif qiling"
}
